	(text "If C5301776 has no stock at order time, fit the 2.5 mm SMTSOM2.525BTR (LCSC C49236513): same land, the card end sits 0.5 mm higher."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.38 143.51 0)
		(effects
